Read-only preparation is complete against main fb1bea1a8f359c8c52f32dbaa9a6e4e125e16965. Active implementation time remains 0.

Implementation remains blocked by the approved dependency rule until #10 is merged and its exact-main trusted deployment passes. The eventual slice should:

- add independent NOT_REQUESTED / REQUESTED / SAVED / FAILED explanation state without mutating deterministic scan status, outcome, or differences;
