- use the official TypeScript SDK Responses parse helper with a Zod Structured Output schema, maxRetries: 0, one bounded timeout, store: false, and bounded output;
- persist refusal, incomplete/invalid output, timeout, configuration, and provider errors as safe explanation failures;
- add parameterized success tests for IN_SYNC / DRIFTED / MISSING_LIVE, saved-result call-count proof, restart persistence, exact payload allowlist, truth-boundary equality, failure matrix, manual-click UI behavior, and no-retry proof.

Official references:
- https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/structured-outputs
- https://github.com/openai/openai-node#retries
