The implementation agent stopped before publication at the approved 10-active-minute target. Source remains preserved, uncommitted, in the dedicated #11 worktree; no readiness claim was made.

Completed focused evidence before stop:

- strict TypeScript passed;
- 33 focused tests passed across explanation service, operator console, OpenAPI, and repository files;
- changed files were formatted and `git diff --check` passed;
- no network/provider call was made.

Owner review identified the remaining acceptance evidence/corrections before publication:

1. filter the provider live-container projection to desired regular-container names so live-only injected sidecars remain excluded;
